Package: asaData
Type: Package
Title: Download Datasets from 'Applied Survival Analysis'
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(c("Graeme", "L."), "Hickey", email = "graemeleehickey@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An unofficial companion package to the first and second editions
    of 'Applied Survival Analysis: Regression Modeling of Time to Event Data'
    by Hosmer and Lemeshow (1999) <ISBN:9780471154105>, and Hosmer, Lemeshow,
    and May (2008) <doi:10.1002/9780470258019>. Downloads and imports 16 datasets
    directly from Wiley companion archives, with source checksums, original
    numeric coding, parsed dates, and documentation of variables and edition
    differences. No dataset records or original codebooks are included.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-GB
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Suggests:
    survival,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/graemeleehickey/asaData
BugReports: https://github.com/graemeleehickey/asaData/issues
Roxygen: list(markdown = FALSE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
